[General]
; Dagric OS — this is no longer the login screen. It is the rescue.
;
; /etc/sddm.conf.d/10-dagric.conf now selects our own theme, in
; /usr/share/sddm/themes/dagric/. This file stays because the documented way
; out of a broken greeter is to set Current=breeze, and somebody doing that
; from a text console at 2am should land on a screen that still looks like the
; product they bought rather than on stock KDE.
;
; It is deliberately the SAME background and the SAME logo as the real theme,
; and that is the only thing it can be: Breeze's Main.qml reads six keys —
; background, color, type, logo, showlogo, showClock — and nothing else. There
; is no layout, no typography and no spacing to reach from here. That ceiling
; is exactly why the Dagric theme exists.
;
; If the art ever moves, both this file and
; /usr/share/sddm/themes/dagric/theme.conf have to move with it.
type=image
background=/usr/share/dagric/sddm/background.png
color=#0a111c
fontSize=10
showClock=true
showlogo=shown
logo=/usr/share/dagric/logo/dagric-logo.png
